  "description": "Dependency injection integration for Twinify. Adds AddTwinify(), AddTwinifyProfiles(), ScanForProfiles(),\n\t\tEnableConventionMaps() / AllowMappingWithoutProfiles(), and ValidateMappings() for IServiceCollection.\n\t\tAddTwinify() with no profiles maps matching DTOs by convention. With AddProfile, add\n\t\tAllowMappingWithoutProfiles() to also map undeclared pairs without changing how IMapper is injected.",
